@host = http://localhost:5088

### Restaurant catalogue
GET {{host}}/api/restaurants

### Menu of the first restaurant
GET {{host}}/api/restaurants/1/menu

### Loyalty points before purchase (80 for seeded customer)
GET {{host}}/api/loyalty/Олена

### Create an order and redeem 30 points
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Олена",
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "items": [
    { "menuItemId": 101, "quantity": 1 },
    { "menuItemId": 102, "quantity": 1 },
    { "menuItemId": 103, "quantity": 1 }
  ],
  "redeemPoints": 30
}

### Orders list after POST
GET {{host}}/api/orders

### Loyalty after purchase (80 - 30 + floor(320 / 10) = 82)
GET {{host}}/api/loyalty/Олена
